 "note": "Every raw stream maps to canonical table(s) or declares unused with a reason. The coverage gate (clinical_core.agere.canonical.coverage) fails a build on any stream absent here or mapped to an unknown table. Tables marked all_streams read every stream (delivery dates, supersessions) and are not listed per stream. 'tuva' names the Tuva Project input-layer table (or core table) each canonical table feeds.",
